{"title":"Kobold Digger","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 13 Kobold that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 3 times (2.2% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/kobold-digger\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/kobold-digger?lv=13\">Lv 13 <span>25</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/kobold-digger?lv=14\">Lv 14 <span>41</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/kobold-digger?lv=15\">Lv 15 <span>22</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/kobold-digger?lv=16\">Lv 16 <span>35</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/kobold-digger?lv=17\">Lv 17 <span>40</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/kobold-digger?lv=18\">Lv 18 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/kobold-digger?lv=20\">Lv 20 <span>5</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/kobold-digger?lv=21\">Lv 21 <span>4</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/kobold-digger?lv=13\" title=\"Pick level 13\"><td><b>13</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>40